      "source": "Such TargetSources must run in a <a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>, as it needs to\ncall the <code>getBean</code> method to create a new prototype instance.\nTherefore, this base class extends <a href=\"AbstractBeanFactoryBasedTargetSource.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aop.target\"><code>AbstractBeanFactoryBasedTargetSource</code></a>.",
      "translation": "此类 TargetSources 必须在 `<a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>` 中运行，因为它需要调用 `<code>getBean</code>` 方法来创建新的原型实例。因此，该基类扩展了 `<a href=\"AbstractBeanFactoryBasedTargetSource.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aop.target\"><code>AbstractBeanFactoryBasedTargetSource</code></a>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Subclasses should call this method to destroy an obsolete prototype instance.",
      "translation": "子类应调用此方法来销毁过时的原型实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Subclasses should call this method to create a new prototype instance.",
      "translation": "子类应调用此方法来创建新的原型实例。",
      "count": 2
